Package: limestab
Type: Package
Title: Stable Local Interpretable Model-Agnostic Explanations (LIME,
        OptiLIME, BayLIME, ALIME)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Simay", "Toparlak",
           email = "simay.toparlak@metu.edu.tr",
           role = c("aut"),
           comment = c(affiliation = "Department of Biomedical Engineering, Middle East Technical University")),
    person("Vilda", "Purutcuoglu",
           email = "vpurutcu@metu.edu.tr",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(affiliation = "Department of Statistics, Middle East Technical University")))
Description: Provides four local explanation methods for tabular data: LIME, OptiLIME, BayLIME, and ALIME, together with the stability metrics used to compare them across repeated explanations of the same instance: the Coefficient Stability Index (CSI), the Variable Stability Index (VSI), Median Rank Matching Stability (MRMS), Point-Based Stability Index (PCSI), and Interval Coefficient Stability Index (ICSI).
    The methodology accompanies Toparlak and Purutcuoglu, "A Median-Based
    Framework for Assessing the Stability in XAI Tools" (manuscript under
    revision); the citation will be updated upon publication.
